WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:19.920
<b>2nd

Basement

Floor</b>

3
00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:28.580
Let me tell you
my true name.

4
00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:31.500
It's Trafalgar "D." Water Law.

5
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:37.260
A hidden name then?

6
00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:37.920
Yes.

7
00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:42.680
That's a surprise.
And a "D."? I never knew.

8
00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.980
I told you because I trust you.

9
00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:50.300
Thank you.
Sadly, I don't know much either.

10
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.400
Luffy doesn't care
about the Will of D.

11
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.400
But I care a great deal.

12
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.440
Perhaps we'll learn together.

13
00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:02.360
All we can do is
follow the red stones?

14
00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:04.200
So it seems.

15
00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.120
In other words,
we must defeat the Emperors.

16
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:11.120
Because I doubt they're
going to share with us.

17
00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:16.450
This isn't it.
I need red ones.

18
00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:20.290
The people of the D.
have been given another title.

19
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:24.050
"Enemies of the gods."

20
00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:39.090
I'm sorry, Cora.
I can't let it go.

21
00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:42.100
I wanna know why
I've suffered this fate

22
00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.470
and lived this checkered life.

23
00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:01.670
Lammy, no!

24
00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.250
Gimme that vial!

25
00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:24.630
Usopp! Are you okay?

26
00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:28.930
Oh, hey, Nami.
What are you doing here?

27
00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:31.340
A quick reminder, Apoo.

28
00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:33.510
Of course, you're not okay.

29
00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:37.850
But I am! So that's
good at least, right?

30
00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.770
Yay?

31
00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:41.370
<b>Flame Clouds</b>

32
00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.690
What happened, Otama?
How did you get here?

33
00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:47.610
One of the enemies gave me
a boat ride to the island!

34
00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:49.570
An enemy? Wait, what?

35
00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:53.820
Go, Pay-Pay!
Chew that dog up!

36
00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:55.740
Ugh, do it yourself!

37
00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.080
Huh?

38
00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:09.670
Now who in the hell
is this big, hairy dope?

39
00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:10.920
Go, Hihimaru!

40
00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:14.430
You gotta hold them off
for three minutes!

41
00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:17.600
Those two are really dangerous.

42
00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:20.640
I'm afraid your big monkey
friend might get hurt.

43
00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.810
Do not underestimate us, Onami.

44
00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:24.600
This is war.

45
00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:26.690
We're here to fight as samurai!

46
00:04:26.690 --> 00:04:29.320
And that's what we'll do!

47
00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.200
Get out of my way!

48
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.960
Oh, c'mon.

49
00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:07.480
We can keep this up.
All night, if need be.

50
00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.360
Having said that,
I'd hate to lose

51
00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:11.270
so many members of
the Armored Division

52
00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:14.190
in such a fruitless battle.

53
00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:17.030
You've done enough
damage already.

54
00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.970
Yamato, if you keep
taking bullets like that,

55
00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:56.640
you'll die for sure!

56
00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.520
This is nothing at all!

57
00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:04.440
If you're a samurai,

58
00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.690
you know where
your loyalty lies!

59
00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:09.820
Leave me here,
and take Lord Momonosuke!

60
00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.490
I refuse!

61
00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:15.740
If it were Oden...

62
00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:21.540
If it were Kozuki Oden here,

63
00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:24.750
he would not abandon you! Never!

64
00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:45.260
Do you think I'm
so easy to defeat

65
00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:48.640
that you can do it while
protecting those fools?

66
00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:52.140
I take that as an insult.
I won't stand for it.

67
00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.100
Say what you will.

68
00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:24.950
What the hell?

69
00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.830
Big boy comin' through!

70
00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:30.920
Move it or lose it!

71
00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:34.500
Ain't no stopping this train!

72
00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:36.090
Franosuke!

73
00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:38.210
Goro-nya!

74
00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:40.550
Huh? Momo?

75
00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:42.130
Glad you're alive, buddy!

76
00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:44.550
Uh, Shinobu, you...you good?

77
00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:46.470
Wait a sec.

78
00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:50.680
It really is him!

79
00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:54.190
He's part of Luffy's crew!
Cyborg Franky!

80
00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:57.280
He's worth 94 million berries!

81
00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:06.130
I never thought
I'd see him in person!

82
00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:09.910
Hm?

83
00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.580
Of course not!

84
00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:15.070
Haccha!

85
00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:18.200
Haccha? Why are you here?

86
00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.830
Huh? Aw crap. This guy!

87
00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:26.080
Whoa!
Don't do it, man!

88
00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.330
No need to throw a tantrum

89
00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:29.460
just because you
lost your new toy!

90
00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:42.270
Haccha!

91
00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:45.760
Don't lose sight of them,
Armored Division!

92
00:08:45.760 --> 00:08:48.770
Chase them down and
murder that little brat!

93
00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:57.380
Not yet! Kaido!

94
00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:02.700
He took out the whole floor.

95
00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.580
Luckily, we can land underneath!

96
00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:06.960
Don't worry,
it's all right if we fall!

97
00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:09.040
We'll make our escape
from the bottom!

98
00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:10.420
Momo! Shinobu!

99
00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:13.670
Are you okay?
Did you get caught?

100
00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:16.590
No, it's fine!
This fellow is our new ally!

101
00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:20.050
I'm leaving the enemies to you!

102
00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:21.930
Good luck, Cyborg Franky!

103
00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:23.050
Uh... Who are you?

104
00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:24.430
I'll keep these two safe.

105
00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:26.440
Luffy entrusted
their lives to me!

106
00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.150
I don't know
who you are,

107
00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:33.070
but if Luffy trusts you,
you can super count on me!

108
00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:35.190
Do not look back!

109
00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:38.700
Hey, Shinobu?
Be right back!

110
00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:42.170
Gotta return the favor
to Franky! Don't worry!

111
00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:44.540
All right, now stay still.

112
00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:53.550
Narikabura Arrow!

113
00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:05.330
<b>Narikabura</b>

114
00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.170
<b>Narikabura Arrow</b>

115
00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:16.580
Nice!

116
00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:28.880
Did he do that?

117
00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:34.340
Who is this dude?

118
00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:35.390
Haccha?

119
00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:38.640
Damn it! Yamato and
Momonosuke are below!

120
00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:40.560
Organize a pursuit unit!

121
00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:44.360
Hurry and catch them!
Get moving!

122
00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:48.120
Armored Division,
take down the damn robot.

123
00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.280
You're still alive?

124
00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:06.070
Once we've triumphed,
you can deliver the final blow.

125
00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:08.280
Momonosuke!

126
00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:10.910
I know this is hard on you.

127
00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:13.900
But you must survive
at all cost!

128
00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.400
For the one who will
lead this world to a new dawn...

129
00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:16.000
Kiku...

130
00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:20.920
Kaido!

131
00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.340
She's coming!

132
00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.510
Why'd she have to show up now?

133
00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:40.770
Don't mind me!
Just on my way up!

134
00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:44.060
It simply wouldn't do
to leave Kaido waiting!

135
00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:09.120
My theory was right!
I know how to fight the virus!

136
00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.290
Some good news for once!

137
00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:20.110
Faster,

138
00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:24.720
This party's
still hopping, baby!

139
00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:26.600
Don't let us down!

140
00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:34.480
Fight it! Don't give up!

141
00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.560
Has it really come to this?

142
00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:41.900
I can't die now! Not yet!

143
00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.950
I don't want my life
to end like this!

144
00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:47.080
It can't be over.
Not after we've come so far!

145
00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:48.760
Help me.

146
00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:34.240
Damn. Can't you
let a brother go?

147
00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:37.950
Pick a fight with literally
anyone else, please!

148
00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:39.160
Apoo!

149
00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.080
Give me the antibody now!

150
00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:45.500
How about hell no!

151
00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:50.880
Back me up! We can do this!

152
00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.230
Hey, what are you doing?

153
00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:01.850
If we don't hurry,
people will die!

154
00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:09.740
Shut up!

155
00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:12.910
Like I said, two on one
is cheating, pal!

156
00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:15.740
If the man wants to do
his own thing, then let him!

157
00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:17.830
Some people have honor!

158
00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:25.170
I dunno what you got going on,

159
00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:27.840
but as long as you
lay off me, we're cool.

160
00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:29.210
Wanna watch the show?

161
00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:31.510
Huh, check it out!

162
00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:01.330
Hey,

163
00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:05.090
Good, just in time.

164
00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:07.590
Thank you!

165
00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:10.220
Can you clean things up
on this floor for me?

166
00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:13.170
I don't have time for
any more of Queen's games.

167
00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:16.010
You're not gonna die, are you?

168
00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:17.270
Of course not!

169
00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:19.100
I've already figured out
how the virus works,

170
00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:21.100
so we'll all be fine.

171
00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.360
There he is.

172
00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:26.220
<b>Third Floor</b>

173
00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.840
He's stealing all the metal
in the whole damn castle!

174
00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:54.340
That's cheating!

175
00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:58.510
That's
Eustass "Captain" Kid!

176
00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:02.970
Stop these guys before
they get to the rooftop!

177
00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:08.270
So, you wanna fight?
I'm more than happy to oblige.

178
00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:12.400
Why don't you help me
carry some of this junk first?

179
00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:22.700
Too tired to stand up?

180
00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:25.410
Then I guess it's time
to take out the trash.

181
00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:37.110
Hey, Killer,
you think this is enough?

182
00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.530
We're about
to face off with

183
00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:43.530
the world's strongest pirate.

184
00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:47.330
I say the more
the better!

185
00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:50.210
I couldn't agree more!

186
00:17:55.760 --> 00:18:00.310
Don't let him up the stairs!

187
00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.530
D'you know what floor we're on?

188
00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:10.030
At the moment,
we're headed to the third floor!

189
00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:12.780
The rooftop is above us
on the fifth floor!

190
00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:16.500
Okay! Kin'emon, hang in there!

191
00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:18.710
It's a lady!

192
00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:21.040
You guys! Did you
hear that just now?

193
00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:22.830
No. Hear what?

194
00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.290
It sounded like it was up ahead.

195
00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:27.250
They must be somewhere
on the third floor.

196
00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.300
Come, my dear,
no need to be shy with me!

197
00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:34.100
Please! No!

198
00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:40.680
I need it!

199
00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.060
You shouldn't do that, my lord!

200
00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.600
It's naughty!

201
00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:57.900
We're almost there, Kin'emon!

202
00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:00.440
Left or right?

203
00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:01.690
Let's head that way!

204
00:19:01.690 --> 00:19:03.110
Got it!

205
00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:09.510
I wonder
what will happen

206
00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:11.430
if I pull on this sash!

207
00:19:11.430 --> 00:19:17.270
You can't, my lord!
You simply can't! It's naughty!

208
00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:19.020
I have an important job to do!

209
00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:21.820
You guys, go on up to
the roof without me!

210
00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:24.610
I'll catch up as soon as
I fulfill my sworn duty!

211
00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:29.860
A lady.

212
00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:30.940
She's close!

213
00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:33.030
That's naughty!

214
00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:36.870
She's calling for help!

215
00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.950
So naughty!

216
00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:42.120
Yes, come closer!

217
00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:49.130
Oh, the shame!
How scandalous!

218
00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:52.470
Don't be shy,
you saucy little thing!

219
00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:55.760
Oh! This is wrong!

220
00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:57.300
Don't be shy!

221
00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:00.350
This is wrong!

222
00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:01.890
Don't be shy!

223
00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:07.190
This is wrong!
It's naughty!

224
00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:11.570
This is the famous
samurai-style sexual harassment!

225
00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:13.240
So the legends were true!

226
00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:16.700
That's naughty!

227
00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:18.450
Someone in
a position of power is

228
00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:21.830
untying a helpless
woman's kimono.

229
00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:23.500
Round and round she goes,

230
00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:26.960
and with each turn,
she loses a little more.

231
00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:30.540
Not just her clothing,
but her dignity!

232
00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:36.590
I'm coming! I'll rescue you!

233
00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:37.720
Don't be shy.

234
00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:43.100
The lady said no! Now back off!

235
00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:47.940
Whoa! What the hell?

236
00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:52.280
So naughty!

237
00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:54.190
A spider web?

238
00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:57.240
So naughty!

239
00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:58.780
Hey, stop it!

240
00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:01.620
Naughty, naughty!

241
00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:07.880
– Naughty Trap!
– Naughty Trap!

242
00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:25.560
I have a feeling
you were driven by

243
00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:28.310
more than just your
sense of justice.

244
00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.250
Damn it, a trap.

245
00:21:30.940 --> 00:21:34.990
Black-Leg Sanji
of the Straw Hats. That's him.

246
00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:38.070
His bounty is
330 million berries!

247
00:21:38.070 --> 00:21:40.990
I think that's even
higher than his crewmate, Zoro.

248
00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:43.700
They give high-level bounties
to any idiot these days.

249
00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:46.500
But wow! That's big game!

250
00:21:48.020 --> 00:21:51.440
Just untie me!
I'll let you girls off easy.

251
00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:54.090
Oh, how scary! That a threat?

252
00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:57.220
I have someplace
I need to be!

253
00:21:57.220 --> 00:22:01.760
It's peaceful here. Just as
a banquet hall should be.

254
00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:03.970
If you go, before I know it,

255
00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:06.820
we'll be wrapped up
in this silly war, too.

256
00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:09.280
Screw you, lady!
My friends need my help!

257
00:22:09.280 --> 00:22:10.990
Get this crap off me!

258
00:22:10.990 --> 00:22:15.330
I admit, I do like
a boy with a dirty mouth.

259
00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:16.920
Talk to me more!

260
00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:20.460
"Boy," huh?
You're underestimating me.

261
00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:25.670
Am I? Then how about
you answer a question.

262
00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:29.390
You like me, don't you?

263
00:22:29.390 --> 00:22:33.640
The hell I do! You're the enemy!

264
00:22:33.640 --> 00:22:35.930
I don't like you one bit.

265
00:22:38.770 --> 00:22:40.600
But I love you!

266
00:22:42.220 --> 00:22:45.050
<b>Elsewhere,

on the Third Floor...</b>

267
00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:50.240
You're dropping banana
all over me, Gorishiro!

268
00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:53.850
<b>Mizerka
Beast Pirates Headliner
Gorilla Smile Fruit</b>

269
00:22:50.240 --> 00:22:51.400
General Poker!

270
00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:54.870
Straw Hat and Jinbe
are heading your way!

271
00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:56.330
Good, I'm ready.

272
00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:00.150
<b>Poker
Beast Pirates Headliner
Rattlesnake Smile Fruit</b>

273
00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:59.960
Hopefully this won't be
a repeat of my fight with Kid.

274
00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:05.130
Well, well! 1.5 billion, huh?

275
00:23:05.130 --> 00:23:06.630
If I take this guy out,

276
00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:08.960
that'll clear my name
just fine, I'd say!

277
00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:13.120
Seriously? Haven't you
eaten enough?

278
00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:16.950
The Tobi Roppo, huh? I like it.

279
00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:19.120
Hey, Straw Hat.
Over here!

280
00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:20.330
Go up this way!

281
00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:21.420
Who're they?

282
00:23:21.420 --> 00:23:24.090
Hey! I know you!

283
00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:26.090
From Udon, right?

284
00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:30.350
Hey!
Where the hell is Straw Hat?

285
00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:33.100
He should
be there any second now, sir!

286
00:23:33.650 --> 00:23:34.730
Whoa.

287
00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.150
A ladder?

288
00:23:38.150 --> 00:23:40.650
Yeah, to get you
up to the fourth floor!

289
00:23:40.650 --> 00:23:42.280
You can sneak
right past

290
00:23:42.280 --> 00:23:43.620
those enemies by the stairs!

291
00:23:43.620 --> 00:23:46.450
That's great! Thanks a lot!

292
00:23:51.540 --> 00:23:53.830
You coming or not?

293
00:23:56.110 --> 00:24:00.150
Listen up, you guys!

294
00:24:00.150 --> 00:24:02.490
Use fire against the Ice Oni!

295
00:24:02.490 --> 00:24:05.660
The virus is fused with
a gas that chills our bodies!

296
00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:07.330
That's how it spreads!

297
00:24:07.330 --> 00:24:09.000
Here, look at me!

298
00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:09.290
If you are able to warm up your
body, the virus won't spread!

299
00:24:09.290 --> 00:24:13.620
If you're able to warm up your
body, the virus won't spread!

300
00:24:17.380 --> 00:24:18.420
Don't worry!

301
00:24:18.420 --> 00:24:21.340
I'll make antibodies
for everyone!

302
00:24:23.600 --> 00:24:26.570
I'm a doctor!
I'll save everyone!

303
00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:29.100
Friends and enemies alike!

304
00:24:30.560 --> 00:24:33.230
It's not too late?
Even for Omasa?

305
00:24:35.730 --> 00:24:37.570
I won't let you die!

306
00:24:37.570 --> 00:24:40.910
Don't let Queen
use you like a tool!

307
00:24:44.520 --> 00:24:45.370
Not bad, raccoon! I'm impressed!

308
00:24:45.370 --> 00:24:48.920
Damn, raccoon! I'm impressed!

309
00:24:49.190 --> 00:24:52.240
Apoo, on the other hand.
Why do you suck so much?

310
00:24:52.240 --> 00:24:55.320
Actually, never mind.
You both suck equally!

311
00:24:55.320 --> 00:24:59.540
You wanna mess up my game?
Well, I'm gonna mess you up!

312
00:24:59.540 --> 00:25:01.460
It's about to be a bloodbath!

313
00:25:01.460 --> 00:25:03.750
Suck on this!

314
00:25:10.720 --> 00:25:12.350
Screw your damn game!

315
00:25:12.350 --> 00:25:13.600
What?

316
00:25:13.600 --> 00:25:15.180
You think we brought
a whole army of samurai

317
00:25:15.180 --> 00:25:16.810
out here just to play with you?

318
00:25:16.810 --> 00:25:19.850
You're wasting time
and you're wasting lives!

319
00:25:19.850 --> 00:25:22.560
They say Kaido is the strongest
in the world, right?

320
00:25:22.560 --> 00:25:25.860
Well, I came here to
chop the bastard up!

321
00:25:32.410 --> 00:25:33.740
What the hell?

322
00:25:33.740 --> 00:25:36.540
Did he get so pissed off
it caused an earthquake?

323
00:25:36.540 --> 00:25:39.750
It can't be!
That's Conqueror's Haki!

324
00:25:47.770 --> 00:25:52.060
Grab something! Brace yourselves
and try to stay steady!

325
00:25:53.290 --> 00:25:56.070
What in blazes
did you just do?

326
00:25:56.070 --> 00:25:57.570
Such terrifying power!

327
00:25:57.570 --> 00:25:59.910
Come on, there's no way
that was me.

328
00:26:04.410 --> 00:26:06.540
What is this? An earthquake?

329
00:26:06.540 --> 00:26:08.830
This is scaring me!

330
00:26:08.830 --> 00:26:11.750
I mean, I'm not scared one bit!

331
00:26:11.750 --> 00:26:14.590
We'll be fine!
Let's keep moving forward!

332
00:26:14.590 --> 00:26:15.960
Speed it up, please!

333
00:26:22.760 --> 00:26:25.390
Hm? Got any idea
what's going on?

334
00:26:25.390 --> 00:26:27.020
It feels like an earthquake!

335
00:26:27.020 --> 00:26:30.520
This island is an unusual place,
so it's hard to guess.

336
00:26:45.660 --> 00:26:48.460
We're never gonna
reach the shore like this!

337
00:26:48.460 --> 00:26:50.830
Pull away from
Onigashima for now!

338
00:27:03.090 --> 00:27:04.560
What happened?

339
00:27:06.010 --> 00:27:08.520
Impatient as ever.

340
00:27:13.480 --> 00:27:16.110
The island isn't sinking, is it?

341
00:27:37.420 --> 00:27:41.220
Seriously,
what the hell is going on here?

342
00:27:41.220 --> 00:27:44.550
Hope the captain is all right.
This looks ugly.

343
00:27:49.690 --> 00:27:54.490
<b>Port Area,

Outside the Dome</b>

344
00:27:55.400 --> 00:27:56.820
Don't worry, Momonosuke.

345
00:27:56.820 --> 00:27:58.610
I will make sure
you survive this!

346
00:27:58.610 --> 00:28:01.700
We need to find a ship,
then get you out!

347
00:28:01.700 --> 00:28:05.700
I have a bad feeling.
We'd better move quickly!

348
00:28:11.150 --> 00:28:12.820
It stopped shaking.

349
00:28:15.880 --> 00:28:18.840
Yeah,
but what was it?

350
00:28:23.870 --> 00:28:27.340
You're worried. I know.
I saw it, too.

351
00:28:27.910 --> 00:28:30.960
Over there. Okiku's arm.

352
00:28:36.290 --> 00:28:38.040
Time's running short.

353
00:28:38.040 --> 00:28:41.460
I wish there was a way
I could just fly up to the roof.

354
00:28:41.460 --> 00:28:44.930
But even if I could,
they wouldn't make it easy.

355
00:29:02.400 --> 00:29:04.030
How's it hangin', Straw Hats?

356
00:29:04.030 --> 00:29:05.660
Marco the Phoenix!

357
00:29:05.660 --> 00:29:07.370
Yup. That's my name.

358
00:29:07.370 --> 00:29:08.660
I thought you guys
were supposed to be

359
00:29:08.660 --> 00:29:09.780
part of the main force?

360
00:29:09.780 --> 00:29:12.000
What are you doin'
all the way down here?

361
00:29:12.000 --> 00:29:15.160
You think we're wasting
time here 'cause we want to?

362
00:29:15.160 --> 00:29:18.340
Well, if you ask nicely,
maybe I can lend a hand!

363
00:29:27.850 --> 00:29:30.470
The Beast Pirates' ship
is supposed to be here,

364
00:29:30.470 --> 00:29:31.560
but it's gone.

365
00:29:31.560 --> 00:29:32.980
What?

366
00:29:48.030 --> 00:29:49.450
And the sea with it!

367
00:29:49.450 --> 00:29:52.870
Slow down!
You're not any making sense!

368
00:29:52.870 --> 00:29:54.790
It's too late!

369
00:29:55.710 --> 00:29:58.540
We can't escape by sea.
We're trapped here!

370
00:29:58.540 --> 00:30:01.960
Why not?
Isn't this place a port?

371
00:30:01.960 --> 00:30:07.340
That earthquake earlier.
I know what happened now.

372
00:30:07.340 --> 00:30:10.720
What is going on,
Yamato? Tell me!

373
00:30:15.290 --> 00:30:18.250
Dragons can create
floating Flame Clouds.

374
00:30:18.250 --> 00:30:18.260
That's how they
travel through the air.

375
00:30:18.260 --> 00:30:20.470
That's how they travel
through the air.

376
00:30:24.300 --> 00:30:26.520
Look down. You'll see!

377
00:30:37.430 --> 00:30:41.640
Kaido is lifting the
entire island with his power!

378
00:30:45.020 --> 00:30:46.730
He's going to
transport Onigashima

379
00:30:46.730 --> 00:30:46.780
to the skies above
the Flower Capital!

380
00:30:46.780 --> 00:30:49.370
to the skies above
the Flower Capital.

381
00:30:55.080 --> 00:30:57.240
That can't be!

382
00:31:35.950 --> 00:31:38.250
Are you
finally satisfied?

383
00:31:38.250 --> 00:31:41.580
The Kozuki Clan is finished.

384
00:31:41.580 --> 00:31:43.670
Now, my plan begins.

385
00:31:43.670 --> 00:31:48.260
The Land of Wano is about
to become New Onigashima.

386
00:32:00.230 --> 00:32:04.900
The new era will be
ruled by violence.
